<br><a target="_self" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" href="/pages/our-winery-howards-folly">Learn More&nbsp;</a></span></p><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-92_ pf-r pf-c-cm pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-sm:2.5px;--s-md:15px;--s-lg:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-93_"><a data-popup-content="youtube" data-src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Vxks8IHJW0A?&autoplay=0&loop=0&mute=0&controls=0&enablejsapi=1" data-action="modal" data-width="854px" data-height="480px" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-jdUdnB gSoeXG pf-94_"><i class="sc-jBeCGk cNfKko pf-95_ pfaV4 pfaV4-play-circle-o" data-pf-type="Icon"></i><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-hyBbPk YitzX pf-96_">Explore HF</span></a></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-97_"><a href="/pages/restaurant-and-visitor-centre-howards-folly" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-jdUdnB gSoeXG pf-98_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-hyBbPk YitzX pf-100_">Restaurant</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-101_ pf-r pf-c-cb" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-102_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-jlGhtx lgBOZV pf-103_ pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0608/9428/1940/t/3/assets/separator-1650718943655_1200x.png?v=1650718944" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0608/9428/1940/t/3/assets/separator-1650718943655.png?v=1650718944 1536w" width="5000" height="100" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy"/></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-bc96" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-epRwmx cpmRjY pf-104_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-djVWQC dKziBg"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-105_ pf-r pf-c-ct pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;--s-md:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-106_"><h1 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bhqpXc iRdflB pf-107_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-hyBbPk YitzX pf-109_">Our Story</span></h1><p class="sc-feopBa gVincu pf-110_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-hyBbPk YitzX pf-112_">Howard’s Folly is an inspiring blend of three key ingredients: an <span style="font-style: italic;">innovative </span>partnership between Chief Winemaker, David Baverstock, and entrepreneur, Howard Bilton; their joint <span style="font-style: italic;">passion </span>to unlock the best of Portugal’s grape varietals; and, a <span style="font-style: italic;">mission </span>to give something back through sponsorship of an arts-based charity for underprivileged children, the Sovereign Art Foundation.<br><br>&nbsp;<span style="font-style: italic;">Innovation</span>, <span style="font-style: italic;">passion </span>and <span style="font-style: italic;">mission </span>drive everything we do, resulting in consistent production of delicious award-winning wines.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-e849" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-epRwmx cpmRjY pf-113_ pf-bg-lazy"><div class="sc-djVWQC dKziBg"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-114_ pf-r pf-c-cm pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;--s-md:15px;--s-lg:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-115_ pf-bg-lazy"><h1 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bhqpXc iRdflB pf-116_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-hyBbPk YitzX pf-118_"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Our Vineyards</span></span></h1><p class="sc-feopBa gVincu pf-119_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-hyBbPk YitzX pf-121_">The richness of the environment gives our wines their characteristic taste and flavour.</span></p><a href="/pages/our-winery-howards-folly" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-jdUdnB gSoeXG pf-122_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-hyBbPk YitzX pf-124_">Explore our vineyards</span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-1c11" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-epRwmx cpmRjY pf-125_"><div class="sc-djVWQC dKziBg"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-126_ pf-r pf-c-cm pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:5px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-127_ pf-bg-lazy"><div data-pf-type="Block" class="sc-cgjCoP dOTEZX pf-128_"><h1 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bhqpXc iRdflB pf-129_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-hyBbPk YitzX pf-131_"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Art</span></span></h1><p class="sc-feopBa gVincu pf-132_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-hyBbPk YitzX pf-134_">Inspired by the visual arts</span></p></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-135_ pf-r pf-c-cm pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-136_"><a href="/pages/mission-howards-folly" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-jdUdnB gSoeXG pf-137_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-hyBbPk YitzX pf-139_">Discover more</span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-140_ pf-bg-lazy"><div data-pf-type="Block" class="sc-cgjCoP dOTEZX pf-141_"><h1 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bhqpXc iRdflB pf-142_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-hyBbPk YitzX pf-144_"><span style="color: rgb(25